xtile Standard (algodón orgánico)</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>OEKO-TEX:</strong> Libre de sustancias nocivas</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Fair Trade:</strong> Producción ética</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>BCI:</strong> Better Cotton Initiative</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Leather Working Group:</strong> Cuero sostenible</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Cómo Elegir el Material Adecuado</h3>\n\n<p><strong>Para comodidad:</strong> Algodón, lino, bambú, modal</p>\n<p><strong>Para durabilidad:</strong> Poliéster, nylon, denim, cuero</p>\n<p><strong>Para climas cálidos:</strong> Lino, algodón, viscosa</p>\n<p><strong>Para climas fríos:</strong> Lana, cachemira, algodón grueso</p>\n<p><strong>Para deportes:</strong> Poliéster, nylon, spandex</p>\n<p><strong>Para uso formal:</strong> Seda, lana fina, algodón premium</p>\n\n<h3>Información en Etiquetas</h3>\n\n<p>Todas nuestras prendas incluyen:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Composición porcentual de materiales</li>\n  <li>País de origen</li>\n  <li>Instrucciones de cuidado</li>\n  <li>Certificaciones (si aplica)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Preguntas Frecuentes</h3>\n\n<p><strong>¿Son hipoalergénicos?</strong> Algodón orgánico, seda, lana merino son naturalmente hipoalergénicos.</p>\n\n<p><strong>¿Cuál es más duradero?</strong> Nylon y poliéster son más duraderos que materiales naturales.</p>\n\n<p><strong>¿Cuál es más ecológico?</strong> Algodón orgánico, lino, Tencel, materiales reciclados.</p>\n\n<p><em>¿Tienes más preguntas sobre materiales? Contacta a nuestro equipo: info@tutienda.com</em></p>	Guía de Materiales y Tejidos	\N	158888231221	https://ai-shoppings.myshopify.com/pages/guia-de-materiales-y-tejidos	guia-de-materiales-y-tejidos	2026-06-07 07:56:01.955839	2026-01-17 01:43:36.285084	2026-06-07 07:56:01.955839	2511	\N	\N	1	f44c0f70bb87be4e60e5ff1e7265b43809390f12950045a7f6b11f95cebd8233	1
981e63a5-77dc-4e9b-9cb4-2783fcc494dc	account_modifications	en	\N	## Modify or Cancel your Order\n\nWe understand that sometimes you need to make changes to your order. Here's how to do it.\n\n### Modify Order\n\n#### What can I change?\n\n- Mailing address\n- Size or color of products\n- Add or remove products\n- Shipping method\n\n#### When can I make changes?\n\n**⏰ Time limit:** Up to 30 minutes after placing the order\n\n**States that allow modification:**\n\n- ✅ **Payment pending:** Full modification available\n- ✅ **Confirmed:** Limited modification (address only)\n- ❌ **In preparation:** Cannot be modified\n- ❌ **Sent:** Cannot be modified\n\n#### How to modify your order:\n\n1. Log in to your account\n2. Go to "My Orders"\n3. Select the order you wish to modify\n4. Click on "Modify order" (if available)\n5. Make the necessary changes\n6. Confirm the changes\n\n**📧 Alternative method:** Send an email to **pedidos@tutienda.com** with:\n\n- Order number\n- Requested modifications\n- We will respond within 2 hours (office hours)\n\n### Cancel Order\n\n#### When can I cancel?\n\n**Free cancellation:**\n\n- ✅ **Before 1 hour:** Automatic cancellation, immediate refund\n- ✅ **Between 1-24 hours:** Cancellation allowed, refund in 3-5 days\n- ⚠️ **After 24 hours:** Subject to approval\n\n**States:**\n\n- ✅ **Payment pending:** Automatic cancellation\n- ✅ **Confirmed:** Cancellation available\n- ⚠️ **In preparation:** Contact support\n- ❌ **Sent:** Return process (see return policy)\n\n#### How to cancel your order:\n\n1. Log in to your account\n2. Go to "My Orders"\n3. Select the order to cancel\n4. Click on "Cancel order"\n5. Select reason for cancellation (optional)\n6. Confirm the cancellation\n7. You will receive a confirmation email\n\n**📞 Quick method:** Call **+1 (555) 123-4567** (Mon-Fri 9am-6pm)\n\n### Cancellation Refunds\n\n#### Refund times:\n\n- **Credit card:** 5-7 business days\n- **PayPal:** 3-5 business days\n- **Bank transfer:** 7-10 business days\n\n#### Refund amount:\n\n- ✅ **Cancellation <1 hour:** Full refund (100%)\n- ✅ **Cancellation 1-24 hours:** Full refund less $2 administrative fee\n- ⚠️ **Cancellation >24 hours:** Case-by-case evaluation\n\n### Change Shipping Address\n\n#### Before shipping:\n\n1. Log in to your account\n2. Go to "My Orders"\n3. Click on "Update address"\n4. Enter new address\n5. Confirm change\n\n**⚠️ Important:** If the order has already been shipped, contact the shipping company directly with the tracking number.\n\n#### After shipment:\n\nOptions:\n\n- **Redirection:** Contact the shipping company (may incur additional costs)\n- **Rejection at destination:** If you refuse the package, it will be returned to us, and we will issue a refund.\n\n### Change Products\n\n#### Before shipping:\n\n**Size/color change:**\n\n1. Cancel the original product\n2. Place a new order with the correct size/color.\n3. Or contact support for a direct exchange\n\n**⏰ Deadline:** Before the order enters "Preparation"\n\n#### After shipment:\n\nFollow the standard return process (see Return Policy)\n\n### Add Products to Order\n\n**It is not possible to add products to an existing order.**\n\n**Alternative:**\n\n1. Place a new order with the additional products.\n2. Contact support to combine shipments (if the first one hasn't been sent yet)\n3. Save on shipping costs when orders are combined\n\n### Change Payment Method\n\n#### Order pending payment:\n\n- Select "Change payment method" in the order\n- Choose a new method\n- Complete the payment\n\n#### Order already paid:\n\n**It is not possible to change the payment method.** If you need a refund, please cancel the order.\n\n### Common Problems\n\n#### "I can't cancel my order"\n\n**Possible reasons:**\n\n- Order is already being prepared\n- Order has already been shipped\n- The time limit has passed\n\n**Solution:** Contact support, we will evaluate your case.\n\n#### "My change wasn't saved"\n\n**Steps:**\n\n1. Check your internet connection\n2. Log out and log back in\n3. Try again\n4. If the problem persists, contact support.\n\n#### "I did not receive a cancellation confirmation"\n\n**Check:**\n\n- Spam folder\n- Email entered successfully\n\n**If it doesn't appear:** Contact support with your order number\n\n### Orders with Multiple Products\n\n**Partial cancellation:**\n\n- You can cancel individual products before shipment\n- The refund will be proportional.\n- Shipping costs are recalculated\n\n### Cancellation Policy for Promotions\n\n- **Discount codes:** These will be honored if you reorder on the same day.\n- **Free shipping:** May be forfeited if cancellation reduces the minimum amount.\n- **Limited-time offers:** We do not guarantee the same price if you reorder later\n\n### Contact for Urgent Modifications\n\n**Live chat:** Available in store (immediate response)\n\n**Email:** orders@yourstore.com (response <2 hours)\n\n**Telephone:** +1 (555) 123-4567 (Mon-Fri 9am-6pm)\n\n**WhatsApp:** +1 (555) 123-4567 (Mon-Sat 9am-8pm)\n\n### Important Terms\n\n- All modifications are subject to availability.\n- We do not guarantee a delivery date if the order is modified.\n- Changes of address may result in additional costs\n- Custom orders are non-cancellable\n\n*Your satisfaction is our priority. If you have any questions, please contact us!*	<h2> Modify or Cancel your Order</h2>\n\n\n <p>We understand that sometimes you need to make changes to your order. Here's how to do it.</p>\n\n\n<h3> Modify Order</h3>\n\n\n<h4> What can I change?</h4>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Mailing address</li>\n\n<li> Size or color of products</li>\n\n<li> Add or remove products</li>\n\n<li> Shipping method</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> When can I make changes?</h4>\n\n\n<p> <strong>⏰ Time limit:</strong> Up to 30 minutes after placing the order</p>\n\n\n<p> <strong>States that allow modification:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> ✅ <strong>Payment pending:</strong> Full modification available</li>\n\n<li> ✅ <strong>Confirmed:</strong> Limited modification (address only)</li>\n\n<li> ❌ <strong>In preparation:</strong> Cannot be modified</li>\n\n<li> ❌ <strong>Sent:</strong> Cannot be modified</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> How to modify your order:</h4>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Log in to your account</li>\n\n<li> Go to "My Orders"</li>\n\n<li> Select the order you wish to modify</li>\n\n<li> Click on "Modify order" (if available)</li>\n\n<li> Make the necessary changes</li>\n\n<li> Confirm the changes</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<p> <strong>📧 Alternative method:</strong> Send an email to <strong>pedidos@tutienda.com</strong> with:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Order number</li>\n\n   <li>Requested modifications</li>\n\n<li> We will respond within 2 hours (office hours)</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3> Cancel Order</h3>\n\n\n<h4> When can I cancel?</h4>\n\n\n<p> <strong>Free cancellation:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> ✅ <strong>Before 1 hour:</strong> Automatic cancellation, immediate refund</li>\n\n<li> ✅ <strong>Between 1-24 hours:</strong> Cancellation allowed, refund in 3-5 days</li>\n\n<li> ⚠️ <strong>After 24 hours:</strong> Subject to approval</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<p> <strong>States:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> ✅ <strong>Payment pending:</strong> Automatic cancellation</li>\n\n<li> ✅ <strong>Confirmed:</strong> Cancellation available</li>\n\n<li> ⚠️ <strong>In preparation:</strong> Contact support</li>\n\n<li> ❌ <strong>Sent:</strong> Return process (see return policy)</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> How to cancel your order:</h4>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Log in to your account</li>\n\n<li> Go to "My Orders"</li>\n\n<li> Select the order to cancel</li>\n\n<li> Click on "Cancel order"</li>\n\n<li> Select reason for cancellation (optional)</li>\n\n<li> Confirm the cancellation</li>\n\n<li> You will receive a confirmation email</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n <p><strong>📞 Quick method:</strong> Call <strong>+1 (555) 123-4567</strong> (Mon-Fri 9am-6pm)</p>\n\n\n<h3> Cancellation Refunds</h3>\n\n\n<h4> Refund times:</h4>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Credit car