3> Contact for Urgent Modifications</h3>\n\n\n<p> <strong>Live chat:</strong> Available in store (immediate response)</p>\n\n<p> <strong>Email:</strong> orders@yourstore.com (response &lt;2 hours)</p>\n\n<p> <strong>Telephone:</strong> +1 (555) 123-4567 (Mon-Fri 9am-6pm)</p>\n\n<p> <strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +1 (555) 123-4567 (Mon-Sat 9am-8pm)</p>\n\n\n<h3> Important Terms</h3>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> All modifications are subject to availability.</li>\n\n<li> We do not guarantee a delivery date if the order is modified.</li>\n\n<li> Changes of address may result in additional costs</li>\n\n<li> Custom orders are non-cancellable</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<p> <em>Your satisfaction is our priority. If you have any questions, please contact us!</em></p>	Order Cancellations and Modifications	\N	158888329525	https://ai-shoppings.myshopify.com/pages/cancelaciones-y-modificaciones-de-pedidos	cancelaciones-y-modificaciones-de-pedidos	2026-06-02 17:13:31.725015	2026-01-23 02:12:07.317062	2026-06-02 17:13:31.725015	1831	\N	\N	1	6d9cd0df036787deea35544983ca60dacf5db9127c46b4e8b8dac90d8eca0781	1
13ae6e10-7b04-4746-85bd-1a884e3691eb	general_faq	en	\N	## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nFind quick answers to our customers' most common questions.\n\n### About Orders\n\n#### How do I place an order?\n\n1. Browse our store\n2. Add products to cart\n3. Click on the shopping cart\n4. Click on "Proceed to payment"\n5. Enter address and payment method\n6. Confirm your order\n7. You will receive confirmation by email.\n\n#### Do I need to create an account to buy?\n\n**It's not mandatory,** but we recommend creating an account to:\n\n- Track orders easily\n- Save addresses and payment methods\n- View purchase history\n- Access exclusive member offers\n\n#### Can I place orders by phone?\n\nYes, call **+1 (555) 123-4567** (Mon-Fri 9am-6pm) and our team will help you with your order.\n\n#### Will I receive confirmation of my order?\n\nYes, you will receive a confirmation email immediately after completing your order. If you don't receive it, please check your spam folder.\n\n### About Payments\n\n#### What payment methods do you accept?\n\n- Credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, Amex)\n- Debit cards\n- PayPal\n- Apple Pay\n- Google Pay\n- Bank transfer (for large orders)\n\n#### Is it safe to pay online?\n\n**Yes, completely safe.** We use:\n\n- Site-wide SSL encryption\n- PCI-DSS certified payment processors\n- We do not store card data on our servers\n\n#### Can I pay in installments?\n\nYes, we offer interest-free installment payment plans for purchases over $50. Select this option at checkout.\n\n#### Do you accept coupons or discount codes?\n\nYes, enter your code in the shopping cart before proceeding to checkout. Only one code per order.\n\n### About Shipping\n\n#### Do you ship to my country?\n\nWe ship to all countries in Latin America and Spain. Check availability by entering your postal code.\n\n#### How long does shipping take?\n\n- **Standard shipping:** 5-7 business days\n- **Express shipping:** 2-3 business days\n- **International shipping:** 10-15 business days\n\n*Estimated times from when the order leaves our warehouse.*\n\n#### How much does shipping cost?\n\n- **Standard shipping:** $5.99\n- **Express shipping:** $12.99\n- **FREE shipping:** on orders over $75\n\n#### How do I track my order?\n\n1. Check the "Order shipped" email\n2. Click on the tracking number\n3. Or enter the number on our tracking page\n4. You can also track from your account: "My Orders"\n\n#### What happens if I'm not home when my order arrives?\n\nThe courier will leave a notice with instructions for:\n\n- Collect at delivery point\n- Reschedule delivery\n- Authorize delivery without signature (according to parcel policy)\n\n### About Products\n\n#### How do I know what size to choose?\n\nConsult our **Size Guide** available on each product page. If you have any questions:\n\n- Use our size calculator\n- Read the reviews (we indicate if it's large/small)\n- Contact our team\n\n#### Are the products original/authentic?\n\n**Yes, 100% original.** We work directly with manufacturers and authorized distributors. All our brands are authentic.\n\n#### Do they have a physical store?\n\nWe currently operate only online, which allows us to offer better prices and a wider variety.\n\n#### Can I see the product before buying it?\n\nWe offer:\n\n- High-resolution photos\n- Product videos (for selected items)\n- Customer reviews with photos\n- Easy return policy if you are not satisfied\n\n#### Do you have products in stock?\n\nAvailability is shown for each product:\n\n- **"In stock":** Available for immediate shipment\n- **"Only X left":** Last units\n- **"Out of stock":** Activates notification for restocking\n\n### About Returns and Exchanges\n\n#### Can I return a product?\n\nYes, we accept returns within **30 days** of delivery if:\n\n- The product is unused.\n- With original tags\n- In original packaging\n\n#### How do I return something?\n\n1. Start your request from "My Orders"\n2. Print the return label\n3. Pack the product\n4. Send to the address indicated.\n5. Refund within 7-10 days after receiving the product\n\n#### Who pays for return shipping?\n\n- **Defective product:** We cover the shipping\n- **Our mistake:** We cover the shipping\n- **Change of mind:** The customer covers the shipping\n\n#### Do they make direct changes?\n\nWe don't currently make direct changes. The process is:\n\n1. Return the original product\n2. Receive your refund\n3. Place a new order with the correct product.\n\n**Tip:** Order the new product before returning the old one to avoid it running out of stock.\n\n### About the Account\n\n#### How do I create an account?\n\n1. Click on "Create account"\n2. Enter email and password\n3. Confirm your email\n4. Ready!\n\n#### I forgot my password, what do I do?\n\n1. Click on "Forgot your password?"\n2. Enter your email\n3. You will receive a link to reset.\n4. Create a new password\n\n#### How do I change my address or details?\n\n1. Log in\n2. Go to "My Account"\n3. Click on "Edit information"\n4. Update your information\n5. Save the changes\n\n#### Can I delete my account?\n\nYes, contact **privacy@tutienda.com** and we will delete your account and personal data within 30 days.\n\n### About Promotions\n\n#### Do they have a loyalty program?\n\nYes, our "VIP Club" program offers:\n\n- Points for every purchase\n- Exclusive discounts\n- Early access to sales\n- Free shipping on all orders\n\nRegister for free at "My Account" → "VIP Club"\n\n#### How do I subscribe to the newsletter?\n\nEnter your email in the website footer to receive:\n\n- 10% discount on your first purchase\n- Exclusive offers\n- New products and releases\n\n#### How often do they have sales?\n\n- **Black Friday:** November\n- **Cyber ​​Monday:** November\n- **Summer Sales:** July-August\n- **Winter Sales:** January-February\n- **Flash Sales:** Advertised via email and social media\n\n### Support and Contact\n\n#### How do I contact them?\n\n- **Live chat:** Available on the site (Mon-Sat 9am-8pm)\n- **Email:** info@tutienda.com (response <24h)\n- **Telephone:** +1 (555) 123-4567 (Mon-Fri 9am-6pm)\n- **WhatsApp:** +1 (555) 123-4567 (Mon-Sat 9am-8pm)\n- **Social media:** @tutienda (Instagram, Facebook)\n\n#### How long does it take them to respond?\n\n- **Live chat:** Immediate\n- **Email:** Less than 24 hours\n- **Telephone:** Immediate (office hours)\n- **Social media:** 2-4 hours\n\n#### Do you have any guides or tutorials?\n\nYes, visit our "Help" section with:\n\n- Step-by-step guides\n- Tutorial videos\n- Blog articles\n- Style tips\n\n### Security and Privacy\n\n#### Is it safe to buy here?\n\n**Absolutely.** We have:\n\n- SSL Certificate\n- PCI-DSS Payment Processing\n- Strict privacy policy\n- We comply with data protection regulations\n\n#### What do they do with my personal data?\n\nSee our full **Privacy Policy** . Summary:\n\n- We only use your data to process orders.\n- We do not sell your information to third parties.\n- You can request data deletion at any time\n\n#### Will I receive spam?\n\nNo. You will only receive:\n\n- Order confirmations\n- Shipping updates\n- Newsletter (only if you subscribed)\n- You can cancel your subscription at any time\n\n### Others\n\n#### Do they provide invoices?\n\nYes, all purchases include an electronic invoice sent by email. If you need a tax invoice, please request it before completing your order.\n\n#### Do you have gift cards?\n\nYes, available in denominations of $25, $50, $100, and $200. Perfect for gifting!\n\n#### Do you offer gift shipping?\n\nYes, select "It's a gift" at checkout to:\n\n- Include a personalized message\n- We hide prices in our packaging\n- We send directly to the recipient\n\n#### Can I unsubscribe from the newsletter?\n\nYes, click on "Unsubscribe" at the bottom of any email or contact info@tutienda.com\n\n### Didn't you find your answer?\n\n**Contact us:**\n\n- Live chat (bottom right corner)\n- Email: info@tutienda.com\n- Telephone: +1 (555) 123-4567\n\n*We're here to help! 😊*	<h2> Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n\n\n<p> Find quick answers to our customers' most common questions.</p>\n\n\n<h3> About Orders</h3>\n\n\n<h4> How do I place an order?</h4>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Browse our store</li>\n\n   <li>Add products to cart</li>\n\n<li> Click on the shopping cart</li>\n\n<li> Click on "Proceed to payment"</li>\n\n<li> Enter address and payment method</li>\n\n<li> Confirm your order</li>\n\n<li> You will receive confirmation by email.</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<h4> Do I need to create an account to buy?</h4>\n\n\n<p> <strong>It's not mandatory,</strong> but we recommend creating an account to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Track orders easily</li>\n\n<li> Save addresses and payment methods</li>\n\n<li> View purchase history</li>\n\n<li> Access exclusive member offers</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> Can I place orders by phone?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, call <strong>+1 (555) 123-4567</strong> (Mon-Fri 9am-6pm) and our team will help you with your order.</p>\n\n\n<h4> Will I receive confirmation of my order?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, you will receive a confirmation email immediately after completing your order. If you don't receive it, please check your spam folder.</p>\n\n\n<h3> About Payments</h3>\n\n\n<h4> What payment methods do you accept?</h4>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Credit cards (Visa, Mastercard, Amex)</li>\n\n<li> Debit cards</li>\n\n<li> PayPal</li>\n\n<li> Apple Pay</li>\n\n<li> Google Pay</li>\n\n<li> Bank transfer (for large orders)</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> Is it safe to pay online?</h4>\n\n\n<p> <strong>Yes, completely safe.</strong> We use:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n   <li>Site-wide SSL encryption</li>\n\n<li> PCI-DSS certified payment processors</li>\n\n<li> We do not store card data on our servers</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> Can I pay in installments?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, we offer interest-free installment payment plans for purchases over $50. Select this option at checkout.</p>\n\n\n<h4> Do you accept coupons or discount codes?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, enter your code in the shopping cart before proceeding to checkout. Only one code per order.</p>\n\n\n<h3> About Shipping</h3>\n\n\n<h4> Do you ship to my country?</h4>\n\n\n<p> We ship to all countries in Latin America and Spain. Check availability by entering your postal code.</p>\n\n\n<h4> How long does shipping take?</h4>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Standard shipping:</strong> 5-7 business days</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Express shipping:</strong> 2-3 business days</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>International shipping:</strong> 10-15 business days</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<p> <em>Estimated times from when the order leaves our warehouse.</em></p>\n\n\n<h4> How much does shipping cost?</h4>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Standard shipping:</strong> $5.99</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Express shipping:</strong> $12.99</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>FREE shipping:</strong> on orders over $75</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n <h4>How do I track my order?</h4>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Check the "Order shipped" email</li>\n\n<li> Click on the tracking number</li>\n\n<li> Or enter the number on our tracking page</li>\n\n<li> You can also track from your account: "My Orders"</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<h4> What happens if I'm not home when my order arrives?</h4>\n\n\n<p> The courier will leave a notice with instructions for:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Collect at delivery point</li>\n\n<li> Reschedule delivery</li>\n\n<li> Authorize delivery without signature (according to parcel policy)</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3> About Products</h3>\n\n\n<h4> How do I know what size to choose?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Consult our <strong>Size Guide</strong> available on each product page. If you have any questions:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Use our size calculator</li>\n\n<li> Read the reviews (we indicate if it's large/small)</li>\n\n<li> Contact our team</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> Are the products original/authentic?</h4>\n\n\n<p> <strong>Yes, 100% original.</strong> We work directly with manufacturers and authorized distributors. All our brands are authentic.</p>\n\n\n<h4> Do they have a physical store?</h4>\n\n\n<p> We currently operate only online, which allows us to offer better prices and a wider variety.</p>\n\n\n <h4>Can I see the product before buying it?</h4>\n\n\n<p> We offer:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> High-resolution photos</li>\n\n<li> Product videos (for selected items)</li>\n\n<li> Customer reviews with photos</li>\n\n<li> Easy return policy if you are not satisfied</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> Do you have products in stock?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Availability is shown for each product:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>"In stock":</strong> Available for immediate shipment</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>"Only X left":</strong> Last units</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>"Out of stock":</strong> Activates notification for restocking</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3> About Returns and Exchanges</h3>\n\n\n<h4> Can I return a product?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, we accept returns within <strong>30 days</strong> of delivery if:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> The product is unused.</li>\n\n<li> With original tags</li>\n\n<li> In original packaging</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> How do I return something?</h4>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Start your request from "My Orders"</li>\n\n<li> Print the return label</li>\n\n<li> Pack the product</li>\n\n<li> Send to the address indicated.</li>\n\n<li> Refund within 7-10 days after receiving the product</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<h4> Who pays for return shipping?</h4>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Defective product:</strong> We cover the shipping</li>\n\n<li> \n<strong>Our mistake:</strong> We cover the shipping</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Change of mind:</strong> The customer covers the shipping</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> Do they make direct changes?</h4>\n\n\n<p> We don't currently make direct changes. The process is:</p>\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Return the original product</li>\n\n<li> Receive your refund</li>\n\n<li> Place a new order with the correct product.</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<p> <strong>Tip:</strong> Order the new product before returning the old one to avoid it running out of stock.</p>\n\n\n<h3> About the Account</h3>\n\n\n<h4> How do I create an account?</h4>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Click on "Create account"</li>\n\n<li> Enter email and password</li>\n\n<li> Confirm your email</li>\n\n<li> Ready!</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<h4> I forgot my password, what do I do?</h4>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Click on "Forgot your password?"</li>\n\n<li> Enter your email</li>\n\n<li> You will receive a link to reset.</li>\n\n<li> Create a new password</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<h4> How do I change my address or details?</h4>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Log in</li>\n\n<li> Go to "My Account"</li>\n\n<li> Click on "Edit information"</li>\n\n<li> Update your information</li>\n\n<li> Save the changes</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<h4> Can I delete my account?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, contact <strong>privacy@tutienda.com</strong> and we will delete your account and personal data within 30 days.</p>\n\n\n<h3> About Promotions</h3>\n\n\n<h4> Do they have a loyalty program?</h4>\n\n\n <p>Yes, our "VIP Club" program offers:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Points for every purchase</li>\n\n<li> Exclusive discounts</li>\n\n<li> Early access to sales</li>\n\n<li> Free shipping on all orders</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<p> Register for free at "My Account" → "VIP Club"</p>\n\n\n<h4> How do I subscribe to the newsletter?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Enter your email in the website footer to receive:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> 10% discount on your first purchase</li>\n\n<li> Exclusive offers</li>\n\n<li> New products and releases</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> How often do they have sales?</h4>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Black Friday:</strong> November</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Cyber ​​Monday:</strong> November</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Summer Sales:</strong> July-August</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Winter Sales:</strong> January-February</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Flash Sales:</strong> Advertised via email and social media</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3> Support and Contact</h3>\n\n\n<h4> How do I contact them?</h4>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Live chat:</strong> Available on the site (Mon-Sat 9am-8pm)</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Email:</strong> info@tutienda.com (response &lt;24h)</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Telephone:</strong> +1 (555) 123-4567 (Mon-Fri 9am-6pm)</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +1 (555) 123-4567 (Mon-Sat 9am-8pm)</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Social media:</strong> @tutienda (Instagram, Facebook)</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n <h4>How long does it take them to respond?</h4>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Live chat:</strong> Immediate</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Email:</strong> Less than 24 hours</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Telephone:</strong> Immediate (office hours)</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Social media:</strong> 2-4 hours</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> Do you have any guides or tutorials?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, visit our "Help" section with:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Step-by-step guides</li>\n\n<li> Tutorial videos</li>\n\n<li> Blog articles</li>\n\n<li> Style tips</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3> Security and Privacy</h3>\n\n\n<h4> Is it safe to buy here?</h4>\n\n\n<p> <strong>Absolutely.</strong> We have:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> SSL Certificate</li>\n\n<li> PCI-DSS Payment Processing</li>\n\n<li> Strict privacy policy</li>\n\n<li> We comply with data protection regulations</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> What do they do with my personal data?</h4>\n\n\n<p> See our full <strong>Privacy Policy</strong> . Summary:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> We only use your data to process orders.</li>\n\n<li> We do not sell your information to third parties.</li>\n\n<li> You can request data deletion at any time</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> Will I receive spam?</h4>\n\n\n<p> No. You will only receive:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Order confirmations</li>\n\n<li> Shipping updates</li>\n\n<li> Newsletter (only if you subscribed)</li>\n\n   <li>You can cancel your subscription at any time</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3> Others</h3>\n\n\n<h4> Do they provide invoices?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, all purchases include an electronic invoice sent by email. If you need a tax invoice, please request it before completing your order.</p>\n\n\n<h4> Do you have gift cards?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, available in denominations of $25, $50, $100, and $200. Perfect for gifting!</p>\n\n\n<h4> Do you offer gift shipping?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, select "It's a gift" at checkout to:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Include a personalized message</li>\n\n<li> We hide prices in our packaging</li>\n\n<li> We send directly to the recipient</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h4> Can I unsubscribe from the newsletter?</h4>\n\n\n<p> Yes, click on "Unsubscribe" at the bottom of any email or contact info@tutienda.com</p>\n\n\n<h3> Didn't you find your answer?</h3>\n\n\n<p> <strong>Contact us:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Live chat (bottom right corner)</li>\n\n<li> Email: info@tutienda.com</li>\n\n<li> Telephone: +1 (555) 123-4567</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<p> <em>We're here to help! 😊</em></p>	Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)	\N	158888362293	https://ai-shoppings.myshopify.com/pages/preguntas-frecuentes-faq	preguntas-frecuentes-faq	2026-06-07 08:00:45.2524	2026-01-23 02:12:07.911306	2026-06-07 08:00:45.2524	1986	\N	\N	1	13738621d2ec43bd7fadf9a33a4de058d112d999cb86b53562830befdf8b0403	1
90d1e84e-6d75-40ed-b5d9-6e782f01f4c9	product_care	es	\N	## Cuidado de tus Productos\n\nPara que tus prendas y productos se mantengan en perfectas condiciones, sigue estas recomendaciones de cuidado.\n\n### Cuidado General de Ropa\n\n#### Lavado\n\n- **Lee la etiqueta:** Siempre revisa las instrucciones de lavado específicas\n- **Separa por colores:** Blancos, oscuros y colores vibrantes\n- **Temperatura:** Agua fría o tibia (máx. 30°C) para la mayoría de prendas\n- **Detergente:** Usa detergente suave sin blanqueador\n- **Carga:** No sobrecargues la lavadora (llena máx. ¾)\n\n#### Secado\n\n- **Al aire:** Preferible para mantener forma y color\n- **Secadora:** Temperatura baja, solo si la etiqueta lo permite\n- **Evita sol directo:** Puede decolorar prendas oscuras\n- **Cuelga o dobla inmediatamente:** Para evitar arrugas\n\n#### Planchado\n\n- **Revisa etiqueta:** Temperatura adecuada según material\n- **Plancha del revés:** Protege colores y estampados\n- **Usa vapor:** Efectivo para eliminar arrugas sin contacto\n\n### Cuidado por Material\n\n#### Algodón\n\n- Lavable en máquina (30-40°C)\n- Plancha con temperatura media-alta\n- Puede encogerse en primera lavada\n\n#### Poliéster\n\n- Lavable en máquina (agua fría)\n- Secado rápido\n- Plancha con temperatura baja\n- Resistente a arrugas\n\n#### Lana\n\n- Lavado a mano o ciclo delicado\n- Agua fría, detergente para lana\n- Secar plano, no colgar\n- No retorcer\n\n#### Seda\n\n- Lavado a mano preferible\n- Agua fría, detergente suave\n- No exprimir, secar con toalla\n- Plancha del revés con temperatura baja\n\n#### Cuero y Gamuza\n\n- NO lavar en máquina ni sumergir\n- Limpieza profesional recomendada\n- Limpiar manchas con paño húmedo\n- Usar productos específicos para cuero\n\n#### Denim (Mezclilla)\n\n- Lavar del revés (protege color)\n- Agua fría\n- Limitar lavados (mantiene color y forma)\n- Secar al aire preferiblemente\n\n### Cuidado de Calzado\n\n#### Tenis/Zapatillas\n\n- Quitar cordones y plantillas antes de lavar\n- Lavado a mano con cepillo y jabón suave\n- Secar al aire, rellenar con papel\n- NO secar en secadora (puede deformar)\n\n#### Zapatos de Cuero\n\n- Limpiar con paño húmedo\n- Aplicar crema o betún regularmente\n- Usar hormas para mantener forma\n- Guardar en lugar seco y ventilado\n\n### Almacenamiento\n\n- **Limpia antes de guardar:** Evita manchas permanentes\n- **Dobla knits (tejidos):** Colgar puede deformarlos\n- **Cuelga camisas y vestidos:** En perchas acolchadas\n- **Bolsas transpirables:** Para proteger de polvo\n- **Lugar seco:** Evita humedad y moho\n\n### Manchas Comunes\n\n#### Grasa/Aceite\n\nAplica talco o maicena, deja absorber 30 min, sacude y lava\n\n#### Vino Tinto\n\nRocía con agua carbonatada o sal inmediatamente, luego lava\n\n#### Café/Té\n\nEnjuaga con agua fría inmediatamente, luego lava normalmente\n\n#### Tinta\n\nAplica alcohol isopropílico con algodón, deja actuar y lava\n\n#### Sudor\n\nMezcla bicarbonato + agua, aplica en la mancha, deja 1 hora, lava\n\n**⚠️ Importante:** Actúa rápido con las manchas - mientras más fresca, más fácil de quitar.\n\n### Consejos de Sostenibilidad\n\n- Lava menos frecuentemente (ahorra agua y prolonga vida útil)\n- Usa agua fría (reduce consumo energético)\n- Repara en lugar de desechar\n- Dona o recicla ropa que ya no uses\n\n### ¿Necesitas Ayuda?\n\nSi tienes dudas específicas sobre el cuidado de algún producto:\n\n- **Consulta la etiqueta:** Símbolos de cuidado específicos\n- **Contacta a nuestro equipo:** info@tutienda.com\n- **Chat en vivo:** Disponible en la tienda\n\n*Siguiendo estos consejos, tus productos durarán mucho más tiempo!*	<h2>Cuidado de tus Productos</h2>\n\n<p>Para que tus prendas y productos se mantengan en perfectas condiciones, sigue estas recomendaciones de cuidado.</p>\n\n<h3>Cuidado General de Ropa</h3>\n\n<h4>Lavado</h4>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n<strong>Lee la etiqueta:</strong> Siempre revisa las instrucciones de lavado específicas</li>\n  <li>\n<strong>Separa por colores:<