8e669646-b21f-4e2d-815f-f0d236ab75e9	account_orders	en	\N	## 📍 Order Tracking\n\nStay informed about the status of your order at all times.\n\n### How to Track Your Order\n\n**Option 1: By Email**\n\n1. Check your confirmation email\n2. Look for the tracking number\n3. Click on the tracking link\n4. View the real-time status\n\n**Option 2: In your Account**\n\n1. Log in to [your account](https://ai-shoppings.com/account)\n2. Go to "My Orders"\n3. Select the order you want to track\n4. View all details and status\n\n### Order Status\n\n- **Processing:** We are preparing your order\n- **Packed:** Your order is ready to ship\n- **In transit:** Your order is on its way\n- **Out for delivery:** Will be delivered today\n- **Delivered:** Your order has arrived!\n\n### Processing Times\n\n- **Standard orders:** 1-2 business days\n- **Custom orders:** 3-5 business days\n- **Pre-order orders:** According to the indicated date\n\n### Having trouble with your order?\n\nIf your order is delayed or has problems:\n\n- Wait 24 hours after the estimated date\n- Contact **orders@ai-shoppings.com**\n- Include your order number\n\n### Modify or Cancel Order\n\nYou can modify or cancel your order:\n\n- **Before 2 hours:** Free\n- **After 2 hours:** Check availability\n- **Already sent:** Not possible, but you can return it	<h2> 📍 Order Tracking</h2>\n\n\n<p> Stay informed about the status of your order at all times.</p>\n\n\n<h3> How to Track Your Order</h3>\n\n\n<p> <strong>Option 1: By Email</strong></p>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Check your confirmation email</li>\n\n<li> Look for the tracking number</li>\n\n<li> Click on the tracking link</li>\n\n<li> View the real-time status</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<p> <strong>Option 2: In your Account</strong></p>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Log in to <a href="https://ai-shoppings.com/account">your account</a>\n\n</li>\n\n<li> Go to "My Orders"</li>\n\n<li> Select the order you want to track</li>\n\n<li> View all details and status</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3> Order Stat