r orders &gt;$500</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3> Payment Security</h3>\n\n\n<p> Your information is protected:</p>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> 🔒 256-bit SSL encryption</li>\n\n<li> 🔒 PCI-DSS Certified</li>\n\n<li> 🔒 We do not store your CVV</li>\n\n<li> 🔒 Secure processing via Shopify Payments</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3> Fees and Financing</h3>\n\n\n<p> We offer payment options in installments:</p>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Purchases &gt;$100:</strong> Up to 3 interest-free installments</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Purchases &gt;$300:</strong> Up to 6 interest-free installments</li>\n\n<li>\n\n <strong>Purchases &gt;$500:</strong> Up to 12 interest-free installments</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3> Accepted Currencies</h3>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> USD - US Dollars</li>\n\n<li> EUR - Euros</li>\n\n<li> MXN - Mexican Pesos</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<p> Prices are automatically converted based on your location.</p>\n\n\n<h3> Billing</h3>\n\n\n<p> To request an invoice:</p>\n\n\n<ol>\n\n<li> Send your RFC/Tax ID to <strong>billing@ai-shoppings.com</strong>\n\n</li>\n\n<li> Include your order number</li>\n\n<li> You will receive your invoice within 24-48 hours</li>\n\n\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3> Problems with payment?</h3>\n\n\n<p> If your payment was rejected:</p>\n\n\n<ul>\n\n<li> Verify your card details</li>\n\n   <li>Make sure you have enough funds</li>\n\n<li> Contact your bank</li>\n\n<li> Try another payment method</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<p> For further assistance: <strong>payments@ai-shoppings.com</strong></p>	Payment Methods	\N	158886101301	https://ai-shoppings.myshopify.com/pages/metodos-de-pago	metodos-de-pago	2026-06-07 08:00:21.952368	2026-01-23 02:12:07.90934	2026-06-07 08:00:21.952368	1991	\N	\N	1	a5637248323c9194edebda405e6bb4736fc0c4565948bf3026f6c2b2b6d32d61	1
